# Nougat MMD extraction — stub

**Status:** stub (backfill 2026-07-06).

**Reason:** the primary text extraction (`work/paper.txt`, from
`pdftotext -layout`) provided sufficient fidelity of equations,
coefficient definitions (14-term Pauli family in Sec. 2.4, Eqs. 16-18
for the CS-VQE quantum correction), and the Kirby-Love 2019 closed
form used in this replication. A full Nougat re-OCR (which is
mathpix-flavoured LaTeX-inline math) was not required to reproduce
either headline claim (C1 mean fractional errors, C2 H2/STO-3G qubit
reduction).

**If a downstream user wants the Nougat MMD:**

```
# Requires nougat-ocr (Meta) or the huggingface-hosted equivalent.
# On CherryRd, uicgpu has GPU capacity; free-endpoint compliant.
nougat work/paper.pdf --out extraction/ --model 0.1.0-base
# Output lands at extraction/paper.mmd; rename/symlink to nougat.mmd.
```

